Create a safe AI review archive from a Git repository

Usage: itsulu-repo-sanitizer <COMMAND>

Commands:
  sanitize      Create a sanitized, reproducible review bundle from a Git repository
  list-formats  List supported archive and compression formats
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
